{"version":1,"content":"<p>機電工程署指臺日電梯（香港）在租置屋邨觀塘翠屏北邨及沙田博康邨更換的48部升降機，只按要求安裝耐火門，卻沒安裝耐火門框組件，並報稱完工。</p><p>據悉警方暫時拘捕三人，包括臺日電梯一名公司董事，以及兩名註冊工程師，年齡介乎63歲至82歲。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:40:42.060610+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:13:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T11:17:39.517721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:37:42.997502+00:00","content_hash":"327971dc077446645f90da5d62a9b33eb4b7286bef11f43468c7716456908999","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}